        - connection means - connected to parallel port?  Network?
        
If you look in your /etc/printcap file, there's an entry for the printer.  One
of the items in that entry is "lf" for "Log file".  Look in the specified file
(usually /var/spool/printer-name.log) for any clues as to the problem.

        Stu



